abstract: >
  Analysis code and deposited derived assets for closed-loop hypothesis
  generation and testing of interpretable representational dimensions in
  visually-responsive brain regions, including in-silico FFA dimension
  generation, THINGS-data validation, and targeted fMRI experiment analyses.

keywords:
  - fMRI
  - FFA
  - representational dimensions
  - closed-loop hypothesis generation
